<div id="pfb" class="pf w0 h0" data-page-no="b"><div class="pc pcb w0 h0"><img class="bi x3 y12b w3 h21" alt="" src="bgb.png"/><div class="t m0 x3 he y30 ff9 fs1 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0"><span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff2">第<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">2<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>章<span class="_ _12"> </span>物理层<span class="_ _34"> </span><span class="ff3">2.6<span class="_ _12"> </span></span>信道复用技术<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">(Multiplexing)</span></span></div><div class="t m0 x25 h7 ybe ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">所有用户在不同的时间占用同样的频带宽度。</div><div class="t m0 x25 h7 y12c ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">更有利于数字信号的传输。</div><div class="t m0 x25 h6 y12d ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">缺点<span class="ff4">：<span class="_ _4"></span>若某用户暂时无数据发送，<span class="_ _4"></span>其分配的时隙就会浪费，<span class="_ _4"></span>导致信道利用率不高<span class="_ _29"></span>（因此衍生出了统计</span></div><div class="t m0 x25 h7 y12e ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">时分复用<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">STDM</span>）<span class="_ _2"></span>。</div><div class="t m0 x11 h20 y12f ff6 fs5 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0">2.6.3<span class="_ _32"> </span><span class="ff1">波分复用<span class="_ _28"> </span></span>(W<span class="_ _4"></span>a<span class="_ _3"></span>v<span class="_ _3"></span>elength<span class="_ _28"> </span>Division<span class="_ _28"> </span>Multiplexing,<span class="_ _28"> </span>WDM)</div><div class="t m0 x1e h6 y130 ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">基本原理<span class="ff4">：波分复用即</span>光纤通信中的频分复用<span class="ff4">。</span></div><div class="t m0 x1e h6 y131 ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">机制<span class="ff4">：利用棱镜或光栅，<span class="_ _29"></span>将不同波长（频率）的光信号合并到一根光纤中传输；<span class="_ _29"></span>在接收端，再将不同波长</span></div><div class="t m0 x1e h7 y132 ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">的光信号分离还原。</div><div class="t m0 x1e h6 y133 ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">密集波分复用<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff6">(D<span class="_ _4"></span>WDM)<span class="ff4">：<span class="_ _2c"></span>随着技术进步，<span class="_ _2c"></span>一根光纤上复用的光载波路数越来越多，<span class="_ _2c"></span>这种技术称为密集波分</span></span></div><div class="t m0 x1e h7 y134 ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">复用。</div><div class="t m0 x11 h20 y135 ff6 fs5 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0">2.6.4<span class="_ _32"> </span><span class="ff1">码分复用<span class="_ _28"> </span></span>(Code Division<span class="_ _28"> </span>Multiple<span class="_ _3"></span>xing,<span class="_ _28"> </span>CDM)</div><div class="t m0 x1e h6 y136 ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">基本原理<span class="ff4">：各用户使<span class="_ _f"></span>用经过特殊挑选的不同码型（<span class="ff3">Code Sequence</span>）<span class="_ _33"></span>，在同样的<span class="_ _f"></span>时间使用同样的频带进行通</span></div><div class="t m0 x1e h7 y137 ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">信，不会相互干扰。</div><div class="t m0 x1e h6 y138 ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">码分多址<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff6">(CDMA)<span class="ff4">：是码分复用的一种主要应用形式。</span></span></div><div class="t m0 x1e h6 y139 ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">工作机制<span class="ff4">：</span></div><div class="t m0 x25 h6 y13a ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">每个比特时间被划分为<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff8">𝑚<span class="_ _28"> </span></span>个短的间隔，称为<span class="ff1">码片<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff6">(Chip)</span></span>。通常<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff8">𝑚<span class="_ _9"> </span><span class="ffd">=<span class="_ _28"> </span><span class="ffb">64<span class="_ _0"> </span></span></span></span>或<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ffb">128</span>。</div><div class="t m0 x25 h7 y13b ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">每个站被指派一个唯一的<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff8">𝑚<span class="_ _28"> </span><span class="ff3">bit </span></span>码片序列。</div><div class="t m0 x25 h7 y13c ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">发送数据<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">1<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>时，发送自己的码片序列；发送数据<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">0<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>时，发送该码片序列的二进制反码。</div><div class="t m0 x25 h6 y13d ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">正交性<span class="ff4">：不<span class="_ _f"></span>同站点的码片<span class="_ _f"></span>序列必须相互</span>正<span class="_ _f"></span>交<span class="ff4">（即内积为<span class="_ _28"> </span><span class="ff3">0</span>）<span class="_ _35"></span>，这样接<span class="_ _f"></span>收方可以通过<span class="_ _f"></span>内积运算从混合<span class="_ _f"></span>信</span></div><div class="t m0 x25 h7 y13e ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">号中分离出特定站点的数据。</div><div class="t m0 x1e h6 y13f ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">优点<span class="ff4">：抗干扰能力强，保密性好，频谱利用率高。</span></div><div class="t m0 x3 he y5f ff9 fs1 fc8 sc0 ls0 ws0"><span class="_ _25"> </span><span class="fc7"><span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff4">第<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3 fc0">6<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>页<span class="_ _0"> </span></span><span class="_ _25"> </span><span class="fc9"></span></span></div></div><div class="pi" data-data='{"ctm":[1.000000,0.000000,0.000000,1.000000,0.000000,0.000000]}'></div></div>
